# Sieve Real Graphics: the item on the tracks line, a record sleeve, as audio's (a track is units of audio); begun as a copy of book-audio.obj.
# Built to the templates/ measurements; the front faces +X, towards the corridor, in the
# x = 0 plane, and that face is where the pre-rendered picture goes (faces.ini).
mtllib book-tracks.mtl
o book-tracks
v -0.012684 0.286000 -0.140000
v -0.012684 0.286000 0.140000
v -0.012684 0.006000 -0.140000
v -0.012684 0.006000 0.140000
v 0.000000 0.006000 0.140000
v 0.000000 0.286000 0.140000
v 0.000000 0.286000 -0.140000
v 0.000000 0.006000 -0.140000
vt 0.000000 0.000000
vt 0.000000 0.256000
vt 0.388000 0.256000
vt 0.388000 0.000000
vn 0.0000 0.0000 -1.0000
vn 0.0000 0.0000 1.0000
vn 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
vn 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
s off
usemtl book_pages
f 5/1/4 8/2/4 7/3/4 6/4/4
f 7/3/1 8/2/1 3/2/1 1/3/1
f 5/1/2 6/4/2 2/4/2 4/1/2
f 6/4/3 7/3/3 1/3/3 2/4/3
